Compare typologically {{m|ru|подстрека́ть}}.

Also compare typologically:
* cognate: {{cog|en|egg on}} (ultimately from the same PIE root);
* noncognate: {{m+|cs|nabádat||[[urge]], [[exhort]]}}, akin to {{m+|ru|бода́ть}}, {{m+|bg|подтиквам}}, akin to {{m+|ru|ты́кать}}.

